  "_notes": [
    "Data file awards.biggestBetrayal names Scott as betraying Emma, but the chronicle's Episode 2 vote record shows Scott voted for Anne Maria (his Alliance #2 partner Emma's target), not against Emma — no chronicle evidence supports a Scott→Emma vote betrayal, so it was omitted from Scott's betrayed list.",
    "Data file awards.messiestFeud names Jo and Heather as the season's biggest feud, but the chronicle text never depicts a direct sustained Jo-Heather conflict; Jo's documented feuds in the chronicle are with Mike, Cameron, Zoey, and Harold. Heather was not added to Jo's rivals.",
    "Dakota's episodesLasted is recorded as 6 (the episode in which she quit Edge of Extinction) rather than 1 (her tribal elimination), since she continued to appear on Edge of Extinction through Episode 6 per the chronicle.",
    "Geoff and Sierra each have two elimination events in the chronicle (both returned once from Edge of Extinction before a final elimination). blindsided/blindsidedBy reflects the most clearly-telegraphed instance: Geoff's Episode 10 ouster (flipped by unbreakable partner Zoey). Sierra's eliminations (Episode 3 and Episode 8) were both framed as expected consensus votes, not blindsides.",
    "Alejandro's betrayal of Noah (Episode 9 Part 2) is inferential: the chronicle explicitly lists it among 'Unbreakable Bonds Broken' and frames Alejandro as choosing alliance loyalty over saving Noah, but Alejandro did not personally cast a vote against Noah that tribal."
